  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Agents of Change to study in Yucatan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We believe in education as a way of generating better outcomes for the lives of all those who get it. Impulso Universitario works towards generating opportunities to receive higher education for young people in a situation of socio-economic disadvantage by providing financial aid and additional resources. Through our programs, the project also intends to create conditions for change in the communities of Yucatan, beginning with the students we support acting as catalyzers.</narrative>
  </description>
